<title>USA: High Plains Corp sees small loss in Q1.</title>
<headline>High Plains Corp sees small loss in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Ks. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>High Plains Corp said on Wednesday it expected a small loss for the company's first quarter, ending September 30.</p>
<p>The company said it would suffer a loss because its two manufacturing plants were shut last month and won't open until September. The plants were closed because the high cost of milo and corn have made ethanol production prohibitively expensive, the company said.</p>
</text>
